How accurate are the answers we keep?
Recorded answers on the 2,198 questions. Each curve starts with a model's most confident answers and adds less confident ones. The marks at 20%, 50% and 80% are
shares of the answers, not confidence scores. Each curve ends at the model's accuracy on all answers. No second model answers the rest here. Panels group
related models, decision models first; read each panel's own y axis.

